      "description": {
        "zh": "把海外扩张与国家威望列为长期国策。军方、实业家与地主共同获益，民生和改革集团的影响力下降；帝国声望提高，但军事物资更加昂贵，广泛的海外承诺也削弱行政能力。",
        "en": "Make overseas expansion and national prestige a permanent state mission. Military, industrial and landed interests gain at the expense of civilian reformers, labor and rural communities. Imperial prestige rises, while military supplies cost more and overseas commitments strain bureaucracy."
      },
      "eligibility": {
        "zh": "可对已有原版利益且重点区域已成熟的合格外国州提出主张；每个目标仍须单独通过宣称法案。",
        "en": "Eligible foreign states in mature focus regions with a vanilla regional interest may be claimed; each target still needs its own approved bill."
      },
